            {
              "id": "tnib-f009",
              "slug": "personal-task-dashboard",
              "path": "data/tnib-f009--personal-task-dashboard.md",
              "version": 2,
              "title": "Personal task dashboard",
              "status": "todo",
              "type": "feature",
              "priority": "normal",
              "estimate": "l",
              "created_at": "2026-03-05T11:30:00Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-03-15T10:00:00Z",
              "body": "\nCustomizable personal dashboard showing assigned tasks, upcoming deadlines, and activity summary.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] \"My Tasks\" widget with filtering\n- [ ] Upcoming deadlines widget (next 7 days)\n- [ ] Recent activity feed widget\n- [ ] Draggable widget layout (persisted per user)\n",
              "parent": "tnib-e003",
              "order": "b",
              "etag": "074a44997b9411a3"
            },
            {
              "id": "tnib-f010",
              "slug": "export-reports-csv-pdf",
              "path": "data/tnib-f010--export-reports-csv-pdf.md",
              "version": 2,
              "title": "Export reports to CSV and PDF",
              "status": "draft",
              "type": "feature",
              "priority": "low",
              "estimate": "l",
              "created_at": "2026-03-08T09:00:00Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-03-15T10:00:00Z",
              "body": "\nAllow exporting task lists, sprint reports, and velocity data as CSV or PDF files.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] CSV export for task lists with all fields\n- [ ] PDF report with charts and summary\n- [ ] Scheduled email reports (weekly digest)\n",
              "parent": "tnib-e003",
              "order": "c",
              "etag": "9869563037010667"
            },
            {
              "id": "tnib-b005",
              "slug": "date-picker-timezone",
              "path": "data/tnib-b005--date-picker-timezone.md",
              "version": 2,
              "title": "Date picker shows wrong timezone for remote users",
              "status": "todo",
              "type": "bug",
              "priority": "normal",
              "estimate": "m",
              "created_at": "2026-03-10T09:00:00Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-03-15T10:00:00Z",
              "body": "\n## Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Set system timezone to UTC+9 (Tokyo)\n2. Open task with due date \"2026-03-15\"\n3. Date picker shows \"March 14\" (off by one due to UTC conversion)\n\n## Expected vs Actual\n\n**Expected:** Date picker shows the date as entered, in user's local timezone\n**Actual:** Date displayed relative to UTC, causing off-by-one for users east of UTC\n\n## Root Cause\n\nDates stored as UTC timestamps but rendered without timezone conversion. Should store as date-only (no time component) or convert to user's timezone on display.\n",
              "parent": "tnib-e003",
              "order": "d",
              "area": "web",
              "etag": "8d286d66083ad752"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nib": {
            "id": "tnib-e004",
            "slug": "api-and-integrations",
            "path": "data/tnib-e004--api-and-integrations.md",
            "version": 2,
            "title": "API \u0026 Integrations",
            "status": "todo",
            "type": "epic",
            "priority": "normal",
            "created_at": "2026-02-20T14:00:00Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-03-15T10:00:00Z",
            "body": "\n## Objective\n\nExpose a webhook system for third-party integrations and lay groundwork for future Slack/GitHub integrations.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Webhook registration and delivery with retry\n- [ ] At least one external integration (Slack or GitHub)\n- [ ] REST API documented with OpenAPI spec\n\n## Scope Boundaries\n\n- GraphQL API deferred to v1.2\n- Two-way sync with external tools deferred\n",
            "milestone": "tnib-m001",
            "milestone_order": "d",
            "etag": "f8dd857da2f11646"
          },
          "progress": {
            "total": 3,
            "done": 0,
            "percent": 0,
            "scrapped": 1,
            "deferred": 1
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "tnib-f011",
              "slug": "webhook-delivery-system",
              "path": "data/tnib-f011--webhook-delivery-system.md",
              "version": 2,
              "title": "Webhook delivery system",
              "status": "todo",
              "type": "feature",
              "priority": "normal",
              "estimate": "l",
              "created_at": "2026-03-05T14:00:00Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-03-15T10:00:00Z",
              "body": "\nHTTP webhook system for notifying external services of task events (created, updated, deleted, assigned).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Register webhook URLs with event type filters\n- [ ] HMAC-SHA256 signature verification\n- [ ] Retry with exponential backoff (max 5 attempts)\n- [ ] Delivery log with status and response time\n",
              "parent": "tnib-e004",
              "order": "a",
              "area": "api/webhooks",
              "etag": "4ed4704558027837"
            },
            {
              "id": "tnib-f012",
              "slug": "slack-integration",
              "path": "data/tnib-f012--slack-integration.md",
              "version": 2,
              "title": "Slack integration",
              "status": "deferred",
              "type": "feature",
              "priority": "low",
              "estimate": "l",
              "created_at": "2026-03-08T09:00:00Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-03-15T10:00:00Z",
              "body": "\nSlack bot that posts task updates to channels and allows creating tasks via slash commands.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Slack app with OAuth2 installation flow\n- [ ] `/taskflow create` slash command\n- [ ] Channel notifications for task events\n- [ ] Thread replies linked to task comments\n",
              "parent": "tnib-e004",
              "order": "b",
              "etag": "65efcf0ef6ca3573"
            },
            {
              "id": "tnib-b006",
              "slug": "webhook-missing-updated-at",
              "path": "data/tnib-b006--webhook-missing-updated-at.md",
              "version": 2,
              "title": "Webhook payloads missing updated_at timestamp",
              "status": "todo",
              "type": "bug",
              "priority": "normal",
              "estimate": "s",
              "created_at": "2026-03-10T14:00:00Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-03-15T10:00:00Z",
              "body": "\n## Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Register a webhook for task.updated events\n2. Update a task\n3. Inspect the webhook payload\n\n## Expected vs Actual\n\n**Expected:** Payload includes `updated_at` timestamp\n**Actual:** `updated_at` field is missing from the payload\n\n## Root Cause\n\nWebhook serializer uses `TaskSummary` struct which doesn't include `UpdatedAt` field. Need to add it to the struct and the JSON serialization.\n",
              "parent": "tnib-e004",
              "order": "d",
              "etag": "5bc3a1c0e13cfd91"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "milestone": {
        "id": "tnib-m002",
        "slug": "v1-1-team-collaboration",
