        "created_at": "2026-03-10T09:00:00Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-03-20T11:00:00Z",
        "body": "\nAdd real-time collaboration features, notification system, and activity feeds. Depends on v1.0 infrastructure being stable.\n\n## Goal\n\nEnable teams to collaborate in real-time on shared task boards with live updates and notifications.\n\n## Key Decisions\n\n- WebSocket for real-time (not SSE) — need bidirectional communication\n- Event sourcing for activity feed to support retroactive queries\n",
        "order": "b",
        "etag": "2f99e2b2bbfd625f"
      },
      "progress": {
        "total": 2,
        "done": 0,
        "percent": 0,
        "scrapped": 0,
        "deferred": 0
      },
      "queue": [
        {
          "nib": {
            "id": "tnib-e005",
            "slug": "real-time-collaboration",
            "path": "data/tnib-e005--real-time-collaboration.md",
            "version": 2,
            "title": "Real-time Collaboration",
            "status": "draft",
            "type": "epic",
            "priority": "normal",
            "estimate": "xl",
            "created_at": "2026-03-10T10:00:00Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-03-18T09:00:00Z",
            "body": "\n## Objective\n\nEnable live multi-user editing with WebSocket-based updates and conflict resolution.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] WebSocket server with connection management\n- [ ] Optimistic UI updates with server reconciliation\n- [ ] Activity feed powered by event sourcing\n\n## Scope Boundaries\n\n- Operational transform / CRDT for rich text editing deferred\n- Voice/video collaboration out of scope\n",
            "documents": [
              "docs/websocket-rfc.md"
            ],
            "milestone": "tnib-m002",
            "milestone_order": "a",
            "etag": "4c5a14edf5ecfe06"
          },
          "progress": {
            "total": 2,
            "done": 0,
            "percent": 0,
            "scrapped": 0,
            "deferred": 0
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "tnib-f014",
              "slug": "websocket-live-updates",
              "path": "data/tnib-f014--websocket-live-updates.md",
              "version": 2,
              "title": "WebSocket live updates",
              "status": "draft",
              "type": "feature",
              "priority": "normal",
              "estimate": "xl",
              "created_at": "2026-03-12T09:00:00Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-03-18T09:00:00Z",
              "body": "\nReal-time task board updates via WebSocket connections with optimistic UI and server reconciliation.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] WebSocket server with connection lifecycle management\n- [ ] Client-side optimistic updates with rollback on conflict\n- [ ] Presence indicators (who's viewing what)\n- [ ] Graceful reconnection with state sync\n",
              "parent": "tnib-e005",
              "documents": [
                "docs/websocket-rfc.md"
              ],
              "order": "a",
              "etag": "c67df380067a71e1"
            },
            {
              "id": "tnib-f015",
              "slug": "activity-feed",
              "path": "data/tnib-f015--activity-feed.md",
              "version": 2,
              "title": "Activity feed",
              "status": "draft",
              "type": "feature",
              "priority": "normal",
              "estimate": "l",
              "created_at": "2026-03-12T10:00:00Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-03-18T09:00:00Z",
              "body": "\nChronological activity feed showing task changes, comments, and team activity powered by event sourcing.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Event sourcing pipeline capturing all task mutations\n- [ ] Feed UI with infinite scroll\n- [ ] Filter by user, project, or event type\n- [ ] @mention highlighting\n",
              "parent": "tnib-e005",
              "order": "b",
              "etag": "7103f6fa0485e150"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nib": {
            "id": "tnib-e006",
            "slug": "notifications-system",
            "path": "data/tnib-e006--notifications-system.md",
            "version": 2,
            "title": "Notifications System",
            "status": "draft",
            "type": "epic",
            "priority": "normal",
            "created_at": "2026-03-10T11:00:00Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-03-18T09:00:00Z",
            "body": "\n## Objective\n\nDeliver in-app and email notifications for task assignments, mentions, and deadline reminders.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] In-app notification center with read/unread state\n- [ ] Email digest (daily/weekly configurable)\n- [ ] Push notifications on mobile (PWA)\n\n## Scope Boundaries\n\n- SMS notifications out of scope\n- Notification preferences UI in v1.1, API-only in v1.0\n",
            "milestone": "tnib-m002",
            "milestone_order": "b",
            "etag": "c24a8d59e33595cf"
          },
          "progress": {
            "total": 3,
            "done": 0,
            "percent": 0,
            "scrapped": 0,
            "deferred": 0
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "tnib-f016",
              "slug": "in-app-notification-center",
              "path": "data/tnib-f016--in-app-notification-center.md",
              "version": 2,
              "title": "In-app notification center",
              "status": "draft",
              "type": "feature",
              "priority": "normal",
              "estimate": "m",
              "created_at": "2026-03-12T11:00:00Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-03-18T09:00:00Z",
              "body": "\nBell icon notification center with real-time badge count and read/unread state management.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Notification bell with unread count badge\n- [ ] Dropdown panel with recent notifications\n- [ ] Mark as read (individual and bulk)\n- [ ] Click-through to relevant task/comment\n",
              "parent": "tnib-e006",
              "order": "a",
              "etag": "f5b9eda2917d92d0"
            },
            {
              "id": "tnib-f017",
              "slug": "email-digest-notifications",
              "path": "data/tnib-f017--email-digest-notifications.md",
              "version": 2,
              "title": "Email digest notifications",
              "status": "draft",
              "type": "feature",
              "priority": "low",
              "estimate": "m",
              "created_at": "2026-03-12T11:30:00Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-03-18T09:00:00Z",
              "body": "\nConfigurable email digest summarizing task updates, mentions, and upcoming deadlines.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Daily or weekly digest (user-configurable)\n- [ ] Summary of assigned task changes\n- [ ] Upcoming deadline reminders\n- [ ] Unsubscribe link in every email\n",
              "parent": "tnib-e006",
              "order": "b",
              "etag": "7ecfb346e95a7fb1"
            },
            {
              "id": "tnib-b007",
              "slug": "push-notification-permission",
              "path": "data/tnib-b007--push-notification-permission.md",
              "version": 2,
              "title": "Push notifications not requesting permission on mobile",
              "status": "draft",
              "type": "bug",
              "priority": "low",
              "estimate": "s",
              "created_at": "2026-03-14T09:00:00Z",
              "updated_at": "2026-03-18T09:00:00Z",
              "body": "\n## Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Open app on mobile Safari (iOS 16+)\n2. No permission prompt appears for push notifications\n3. Notification settings show \"Not Determined\"\n\n## Expected vs Actual\n\n**Expected:** Permission prompt shown on first relevant action (e.g., enabling notifications)\n**Actual:** Permission never requested because Service Worker registration fails silently on mobile Safari\n\n## Root Cause\n\nService Worker scope is misconfigured — needs investigation into Safari PWA requirements.\n",
              "parent": "tnib-e006",
              "order": "c",
              "etag": "6a06f65bcf2300c8"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
